<title>USA: Meridian E. Coli tests approved in Japan.</title>
<headline>Meridian E. Coli tests approved in Japan.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meridian Diagnostics Inc said Tuesday its diagnostic tests for the toxin producing strains of E. coli have received approval from the Japanese Ministry of Health.</p>
<p>The company said the name of these tests are premier EHEC and premier 0157.</p>
<p>The company said E. coli toxins can cause severe gastrointestinal damage leading to kidney failure and death, especially in children and the elderly.</p>
</text>
